# What NOT to upload to Cloud Build. Without this, gcloud falls back to
# .gitignore, which would be mostly right but would still ship the local run
# artifacts. Keys are excluded explicitly rather than by inheritance.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.env
.env.local
*.log
data/runs
data/mockups
data/exports
memory/prospects/live-*
.claude
scratchpad
Dockerfile.*
README.md
SUBMISSION.md
